Subject: [PATCH] Reuse GPU page-table walks across nearby buffer bindings

Adapt Heydemoura PR #100 (0076) to T120. Keep the existing locked layout lookup, and only reuse continuous-range walks if the mapping history proves them current. Opt in with EDEN_NX2_PAGE_RANGE_WALK_AHEAD=1.

